Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `volatile_write` writes a Int (a whole number) through this pointer, but the value is String (text)
  --> tests/ui/lowlevel_volatile_write_wrong_value.jet:8:31
    |
  8 |         mem.volatile_write(p, "wrong")
    |                               ^^^^^^^
 Why: A volatile write stores a value of the pointer's element type
 Fix: Write a `Int` value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
